---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Mar Azul Developers Donate Water System to ASADA Santa Marta | Coyol Real Estate">
  <article class="blog-post">
    <header class="post-header">
      <p class="category">Community Impact</p>
      <h1>Mar Azul Developers Donate Water System to ASADA Santa Marta</h1>
      <p class="subtitle">Private investment solves freshwater access for over 250 Costa Rican families in Nosara</p>
      <time datetime="2026-08-01">August 1, 2026</time>
    </header>

    <figure class="hero-image">
      <img src="/images/mar-azul/community-water.jpg" alt="ASADA Santa Marta water infrastructure" />
      <figcaption>The donated well and water infrastructure now serves the local community</figcaption>
    </figure>

    <div class="post-content">
      <p class="lead">When the developers of Mar Azul, a private residential community in Nosara, drilled a well for their project, they saw an opportunity to do more than serve their own residents. Today, that well provides clean drinking water to approximately 250 Costa Rican families through ASADA Santa Marta Beach.</p>

      <h2>From Private Well to Public Resource</h2>
      
      <p>The well, permitted under DA-0080-2022, was originally developed as part of Mar Azul's infrastructure. Rather than keeping this resource private, the developers made the decision to donate the water system to ASADA Santa Marta Beach — the local community water association (Asociación Administradora del Acueducto).</p>
      
      <p>This donation transformed what could have been an exclusive amenity into a community lifeline.</p>

      <h2>Impact on the Community</h2>
      
      <div class="stats-block">
        <div class="stat">
          <span class="number">250+</span>
          <span class="label">Families served</span>
        </div>
        <div class="stat">
          <span class="number">88m</span>
          <span class="label">Well depth</span>
        </div>
        <div class="stat">
          <span class="number">10</span>
          <span class="label">Year concession granted by MINAE</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <p>The well reaches 88 meters deep and produces high-quality freshwater that meets all Costa Rican drinking water standards. In February 2024, ASADA Santa Marta issued official water availability letters confirming the system's capacity to serve both the Mar Azul community and surrounding areas.</p>

      <h2>A Model for Responsible Development</h2>
      
      <p>This kind of private-public partnership represents the best of what responsible real estate development can achieve in Costa Rica. Rather than extracting resources, Mar Azul's developers invested in infrastructure that benefits the broader Nosara community.</p>
      
      <blockquote>
        "Development doesn't have to be at odds with community welfare. When done right, private investment can solve public infrastructure challenges that might otherwise take years to address."
      </blockquote>

      <h2>Government Recognition</h2>
      
      <p>The Ministry of Environment and Energy (MINAE) has recognized the legitimacy of this water system by granting a 10-year concession extension. This official approval confirms that the water source is legally established, properly permitted, and sustainably managed.</p>

      <h2>About Mar Azul</h2>
      
      <p>Mar Azul is a private residential community located in the hills above Nosara, Costa Rica — in the heart of the Nicoya Peninsula Blue Zone. The development combines luxury living with environmental responsibility, featuring native landscaping, wildlife corridors, and community infrastructure that benefits both residents and neighbors.</p>
      
      <p><a href="/developments/mar-azul">Learn more about Mar Azul →</a></p>
    </div>

    <footer class="post-footer">
      <div class="tags">
        <span>Tags:</span>
        <a href="/blog/tag/community">Community</a>
        <a href="/blog/tag/sustainability">Sustainability</a>
        <a href="/blog/tag/mar-azul">Mar Azul</a>
        <a href="/blog/tag/nosara">Nosara</a>
      </div>
    </footer>
  </article>
</Layout>

<style>
  .blog-post {
    max-width: 800px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 4rem 2rem;
  }

  .post-header {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
  }

  .category {
    color: #3D4F3D;
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  h1 {
    font-family: Georgia, serif;
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3rem);
    color: #1A1F16;
    line-height: 1.2;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .subtitle {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    color: #666;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  time {
    color: #888;
    font-size: 0.875rem;
  }

  .hero-image {
    margin: 2rem 0;
  }

  .hero-image img {
    width: 100%;
    border-radius: 8px;
  }

  .hero-image figcaption {
    text-align: center;
    color: #888;
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
  }

  .post-content {
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
    color: #333;
  }

  .post-content h2 {
    font-family: Georgia, serif;
    font-size: 1.75rem;
    color: #1A1F16;
    margin: 2.5rem 0 1rem;
  }

  .post-content p {
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .lead {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    color: #444;
    border-left: 4px solid #3D4F3D;
    padding-left: 1.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .stats-block {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 1.5rem;
    background: #F5F3EF;
    padding: 2rem;
    border-radius: 8px;
    margin: 2rem 0;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .stat .number {
    display: block;
    font-size: 2.5rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #3D4F3D;
  }

  .stat .label {
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: #666;
  }

  blockquote {
    font-style: italic;
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    color: #3D4F3D;
    border-left: 4px solid #C4A67C;
    padding-left: 1.5rem;
    margin: 2rem 0;
  }

  .post-footer {
    margin-top: 3rem;
    padding-top: 2rem;
    border-top: 1px solid #eee;
  }

  .tags {
    display: flex;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .tags span {
    color: #888;
    font-size: 0.875rem;
  }

  .tags a {
    background: #F5F3EF;
    color: #3D4F3D;
    padding: 0.25rem 0.75rem;
    border-radius: 4px;
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .tags a:hover {
    background: #3D4F3D;
    color: white;
  }

  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .stats-block {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
